{"ts": "2026-05-03T03:14:52", "text": "Sector boosts (SEMI/AI multipliers) leaked -24.8 Sharpe in backtest. Removed in May 2 sprint. DO NOT re-introduce blanket sector boosts; instead use sector_alpha tracking + per-pattern hypothesis testing.", "source": "backtester", "confidence": 0.95, "tags": ["sector", "regime", "post-mortem"], "author": "sun-may-3-sprint", "active": true}
{"ts": "2026-05-03T03:14:52", "text": "Backtester proved 5 specific tickers (UNH, TEAM, SMCI, DIS, SCHW) have negative R-multiples across 20 months. Not noise. Excluded permanently in config.yaml. Always validate edge per-ticker, not just per-strategy.", "source": "backtester", "confidence": 0.9, "tags": ["universe", "exclusion"], "author": "sun-may-3-sprint", "active": true}
{"ts": "2026-05-03T03:14:52", "text": "New ML/statistical features ship in OBSERVE-MODE first. Never wire a new signal to auto-block or auto-flip until it has 30+ samples AND statistical significance. Pattern proven on EV-gate, applies to Pillar 1 L4 (hypothesis engine) and Pillar 2 (wisdom_consultant).", "source": "manual", "confidence": 0.95, "tags": ["philosophy", "safety"], "author": "sun-may-3-sprint", "active": true}
{"ts": "2026-05-03T03:14:52", "text": "Pillar 1 (Brain) MUST ship before Pillar 2 (Wisdom) which MUST ship before Pillar 4 (Auto-Adapt). Otherwise wisdom has no inputs and auto-adapt has no signals to flip on. Don't reorder.", "source": "manual", "confidence": 0.85, "tags": ["roadmap", "philosophy"], "author": "sun-may-3-sprint", "active": true}
